BookStack SYNCHRONISATION to Heurist.Huma-Num.fr server

There are three scripts to dump the BookStack database in various formats,

     BookStack_MD_JSon_PNG_Snapshot.sh     complete snapshot as MD, JSon and a files directory
     BookStack_Filesystem_Daily_Dump.sh    MySQL dump
     BookStack_API_Daily_Dump.sh           dump via API in a dated directory, to be kept for 1 month

and two scripts to push the changes to the Huma-Num server and the Heurist gitHub

     BookStack_push_to_remote.sh
     BookStack_Commit_To_GitHub.sh       not working at 21 July 2026 due to git conflicts
